<PageLayout title="Perplexity vs TotalRecalls" description="Perplexity official download vs. TotalRecalls." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Compare", href: "/compare/" }, { label: "Perplexity" }]}>
  <h1>Perplexity vs. TotalRecalls</h1>
  <p>Perplexity allows thread downloads but they arrive as a single ZIP with unstructured data. TotalRecalls gives you organized, tagged, searchable Markdown.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Official download:</strong> ZIP with threads.json — no tags, no organization.</li>
    <li><strong>TotalRecalls:</strong> Per-provider folders, Markdown + JSON, full-text search across your library.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
